<title>UK: Dresdner Finance sets 1.5 bln mark warrant bond.</title>
<headline>Dresdner Finance sets 1.5 bln mark warrant bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dresdner Finance BV has launched a 1.5 billion mark bond with warrants in the form of a rights issue, lead manager Dresdner Kleinwort Benson said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>The seven-year deal is guaranteed by Dresdner Bank AG and will be priced on April 18 to give a spread of 20 b.p. over the Treuhand.</p>
<p>* * * *</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN DEM   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    30.APR.04</p>
<p> TYPE   STR/WW	  ISS PRICE  115 PCT   FULL FEES   2.50</p>
<p> LISTING    =	   DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    1.0	 SELL CONC  1.50	PRAECIPUUM  1/3</p>
<p> NOTES	**TO BE PRICED APRIL 18. EXERCISABLE INTO SHARES OF</p>
<p>DRESDNER BANK AT A DISCOUNT OF 8 PCT TO REFERENCE PRICE (ONE WARRANT PER SHARE). BOOKBUILDING FOR NON-SHARE HOLDERS BEGINS 14.APR. RIGHTS PERIOD TO 24.APR</p>
<p>-- LONDON NEWSROOM +44 171 542 7658</p>
